<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">8.<sp/>Use<sp/>of<sp/>Index.<sp/><sp/>Instead,<sp/>create<sp/>an<sp/>Iterator<sp/>type<sp/>inside</highlight></codeline>
